---
interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const isEs = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="dc-screen" data-presentation="depuracion-codigo-limpio-java">
	<div class="dc-shell">
		<nav class="dc-nav" aria-label="Controles de navegación">
			<button class="dc-btn" id="dcPrevBtn" aria-label="Diapositiva anterior" disabled>
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" />
				</svg>
				<span>{isEs ? 'Anterior' : 'Previous'}</span>
			</button>
			<span class="dc-counter" id="dcSlideCounter" aria-live="polite">1 / 5</span>
			<button class="dc-btn" id="dcNextBtn" aria-label="Siguiente diapositiva">
				<span>{isEs ? 'Siguiente' : 'Next'}</span>
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
					<path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" />
				</svg>
			</button>
		</nav>

		<main class="dc-viewport">
			<!-- Slide 1: El Bucle Científico de Depuración y la Traza de Pila -->
			<section class="dc-slide is-active" data-slide="1">
				<div class="dc-header">
					<span class="dc-kicker">{isEs ? 'Depuración Sistemática' : 'Systematic Debugging'}</span>
					<h2 class="dc-title">{isEs ? 'El Bucle Científico de Depuración y la Traza de Pila' : 'The Scientific Debugging Loop and the Stack Trace'}</h2>
					<p class="dc-lead">
						{isEs
							? 'Depurar no es probar cosas al azar con System.out.println: es un ciclo de investigación empírico. Una traza de pila se lee de arriba hacia abajo hasta encontrar el primer marco de nuestro propio código.'
							: 'Debugging is not randomly poking at code with System.out.println: it is an empirical investigation cycle. A stack trace reads top to bottom until it hits the first frame of our own code.'}
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="dc-card">
					<div class="dc-loop-grid">
						<div class="dc-loop-viz">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 340 300" class="dc-loop-svg" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Diagrama circular del bucle de depuración de 5 pasos' : 'Circular diagram of the 5-step debugging loop'}>
								<circle cx="170" cy="140" r="100" class="dc-loop-ring" />

								<polygon points="0,-6 6,6 -6,6" class="dc-loop-arrow" transform="translate(229,59) rotate(36)" />
								<polygon points="0,-6 6,6 -6,6" class="dc-loop-arrow" transform="translate(265,171) rotate(108)" />
								<polygon points="0,-6 6,6 -6,6" class="dc-loop-arrow" transform="translate(170,240) rotate(180)" />
								<polygon points="0,-6 6,6 -6,6" class="dc-loop-arrow" transform="translate(75,171) rotate(252)" />
								<polygon points="0,-6 6,6 -6,6" class="dc-loop-arrow" transform="translate(111,59) rotate(324)" />

								<g class="dc-loop-step is-active" data-step="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={isEs ? 'Paso 1: Reproducir' : 'Step 1: Reproduce'}>
									<circle cx="170" cy="40" r="34" class="dc-loop-circle" />
									<text x="170" y="47" class="dc-loop-num" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
									<text x="170" y="12" class="dc-loop-label" text-anchor="middle">{isEs ? 'Reproducir' : 'Reproduce'}</text>
								</g>
								<g class="dc-loop-step" data-step="2" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={isEs ? 'Paso 2: Hipótesis' : 'Step 2: Hypothesis'}>
									<circle cx="265" cy="109" r="34" class="dc-loop-circle" />
									<text x="265" y="116" class="dc-loop-num" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
									<text x="303" y="102" class="dc-loop-label" text-anchor="start">{isEs ? 'Hipótesis' : 'Hypothesis'}</text>
								</g>
								<g class="dc-loop-step" data-step="3" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={isEs ? 'Paso 3: Observar' : 'Step 3: Observe'}>
									<circle cx="229" cy="221" r="34" class="dc-loop-circle" />
									<text x="229" y="228" class="dc-loop-num" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
									<text x="238" y="270" class="dc-loop-label" text-anchor="start">{isEs ? 'Observar' : 'Observe'}</text>
								</g>
								<g class="dc-loop-step" data-step="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={isEs ? 'Paso 4: Corregir causa raíz' : 'Step 4: Fix root cause'}>
									<circle cx="111" cy="221" r="34" class="dc-loop-circle" />
									<text x="111" y="228" class="dc-loop-num" text-anchor="middle">4</text>
									<text x="102" y="270" class="dc-loop-label" text-anchor="end">{isEs ? 'Corregir causa raíz' : 'Fix root cause'}</text>
								</g>
								<g class="dc-loop-step" data-step="5" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={isEs ? 'Paso 5: Verificar' : 'Step 5: Verify'}>
									<circle cx="75" cy="109" r="34" class="dc-loop-circle" />
									<text x="75" y="116" class="dc-loop-num" text-anchor="middle">5</text>
									<text x="37" y="102" class="dc-loop-label" text-anchor="end">{isEs ? 'Verificar' : 'Verify'}</text>
								</g>
							</svg>
						</div>

						<div class="dc-loop-caption">
							<strong class="dc-loop-caption-heading">{isEs ? 'Hacé clic en un paso del ciclo' : 'Click a step in the cycle'}</strong>
							<p class="dc-loop-desc is-active" data-step="1">
								{isEs
									? '1. Reproducir: conseguir que el error ocurra de forma consistente y controlada, no depender de la suerte.'
									: '1. Reproduce: make the failure happen consistently and on demand, never rely on luck.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-loop-desc" data-step="2">
								{isEs
									? '2. Hipótesis: formular una explicación concreta y comprobable de la causa probable, antes de tocar código.'
									: '2. Hypothesis: state a concrete, testable explanation of the likely cause before touching any code.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-loop-desc" data-step="3">
								{isEs
									? '3. Observar: usar breakpoints, watches y logs para confirmar o descartar la hipótesis con evidencia real.'
									: '3. Observe: use breakpoints, watches, and logs to confirm or discard the hypothesis with real evidence.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-loop-desc" data-step="4">
								{isEs
									? '4. Corregir causa raíz: arreglar el origen del problema, nunca el síntoma superficial.'
									: '4. Fix root cause: repair the origin of the problem, never the superficial symptom.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-loop-desc" data-step="5">
								{isEs
									? '5. Verificar: confirmar que el error desapareció y que no se rompió nada más.'
									: '5. Verify: confirm the failure is gone and that nothing else broke.'}
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="dc-trace-block">
						<div class="dc-trace-label">
							<strong>{isEs ? 'Simulador: Anatomía de la Traza de Pila' : 'Simulator: Stack Trace Anatomy'}</strong>
							<span class="dc-hint">{isEs ? 'Hacé clic en cada parte para entender la traza' : 'Click each part to understand the trace'}</span>
						</div>
						<div class="dc-trace-tabs">
							<button class="dc-tab is-active" data-part="type">{isEs ? 'Tipo de Excepción' : 'Exception Type'}</button>
							<button class="dc-tab" data-part="message">{isEs ? 'Mensaje' : 'Message'}</button>
							<button class="dc-tab" data-part="stack">{isEs ? 'Call Stack' : 'Call Stack'}</button>
						</div>
						<pre class="dc-console"><code>Exception in thread "main" <span class="dc-part" data-part="type">java.lang.NullPointerException</span>: <span class="dc-part" data-part="message">Cannot invoke "Order.subtotal()"</span>
    at <span class="dc-frame-own dc-part" data-part="stack">OrderCalculator.total(OrderCalculator.java:14)</span> <span class="dc-frame-tag">{isEs ? '◄ marco relevante' : '◄ relevant frame'}</span>
    at <span class="dc-part" data-part="stack">Main.main(Main.java:9)</span></code></pre>
						<div class="dc-explain-panels">
							<p class="dc-explain-desc is-active" data-part="type">
								{isEs
									? 'El tipo de excepción indica la clase de error: NullPointerException señala que se intentó usar una referencia nula.'
									: 'The exception type names the error class: NullPointerException means a null reference was used.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-explain-desc" data-part="message">
								{isEs
									? 'El mensaje explicativo detalla exactamente qué invocación falló: Order.subtotal() sobre un objeto Order nulo.'
									: 'The message details exactly which call failed: Order.subtotal() invoked on a null Order object.'}
							</p>
							<p class="dc-explain-desc" data-part="stack">
								{isEs
									? 'El call stack se lee de arriba hacia abajo: el primer marco de nuestro propio código (OrderCalculator.java:14) es donde hay que empezar a investigar.'
									: 'The call stack reads top to bottom: the first frame belonging to our own code (OrderCalculator.java:14) is where investigation should start.'}
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Slide 2: La Cabina de Mando del Depurador -->
			<section class="dc-slide" data-slide="2">
				<div class="dc-header">
					<span class="dc-kicker">{isEs ? 'Herramientas del IDE' : 'IDE Tooling'}</span>
					<h2 class="dc-title">{isEs ? 'La Cabina de Mando del Depurador' : 'The Debugger Cockpit'}</h2>
					<p class="dc-lead">
						{isEs
							? 'Un depurador congela el tiempo de ejecución de la JVM y permite examinar el estado de la memoria en vivo, sin modificar el archivo fuente. Probá los controles de stepping sobre el código.'
							: 'A debugger freezes the JVM at runtime and lets you inspect live memory state without touching the source file. Try the stepping controls over the code.'}
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="dc-card">
					<div class="dc-ide-grid">
						<div class="dc-ide-source">
							<div class="dc-ide-source-head">
								<span>OrderCalculator.java</span>
							</div>
							<svg viewBox="0 0 280 210" class="dc-code-svg" id="dcCodeSvg">
								<rect x="0" y="0" width="280" height="210" class="dc-code-bg" />
								<rect x="0" y="52" width="280" height="21" class="dc-row-bg is-current" data-line="3" />
								<rect x="0" y="94" width="280" height="21" class="dc-row-bg" data-line="5" />

								<circle cx="14" cy="10" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="1" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="31" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="2" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="63" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot dc-bp-dot-active" data-line="3" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="84" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="4" />
								<g class="dc-bp-cond-group" data-line="5">
									<circle cx="14" cy="105" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot dc-bp-dot-cond" />
									<text x="14" y="108" class="dc-bp-cond-mark" text-anchor="middle">?</text>
								</g>
								<circle cx="14" cy="126" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="6" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="147" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="7" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="168" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="8" />
								<circle cx="14" cy="189" r="5" class="dc-bp-dot" data-line="9" />

								<text x="26" y="14" class="dc-code-line">public int total(Order order) &#123;</text>
								<text x="26" y="35" class="dc-code-line">    int subtotal = 0;</text>
								<text x="26" y="67" class="dc-code-line">    for (Item item : order.getItems()) &#123;</text>
								<text x="26" y="88" class="dc-code-line">        subtotal += item.getPrecio();</text>
								<text x="26" y="109" class="dc-code-line">        if (itemCount &gt; 10) &#123;</text>
								<text x="26" y="130" class="dc-code-line">            subtotal = applyBulkDiscount(subtotal);</text>
								<text x="26" y="151" class="dc-code-line">        &#125;</text>
								<text x="26" y="172" class="dc-code-line">    &#125;</text>
								<text x="26" y="193" class="dc-code-line">    return subtotal;</text>
							</svg>
							<div class="dc-bp-legend">
								<span class="dc-bp-legend-item"><span class="dc-bp-swatch dc-bp-swatch-plain"></span>{isEs ? 'Breakpoint incondicional' : 'Unconditional breakpoint'}</span>
								<span class="dc-bp-legend-item"><span class="dc-bp-swatch dc-bp-swatch-cond"></span>{isEs ? 'Breakpoint condicional: itemCount > 10' : 'Conditional breakpoint: itemCount > 10'}</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="dc-ide-controls">
							<button class="dc-step-btn" id="dcStepOverBtn">
								<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7" /></svg>
								<span>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Step Over' : 'Step Over'}</strong>
									<small>{isEs ? 'Salta la línea sin entrar al método' : 'Skips the line without entering the method'}</small>
								</span>
							</button>
							<button class="dc-step-btn" id="dcStepIntoBtn">
								<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14m-7-7 7 7 7-7" /></svg>
								<span>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Step Into' : 'Step Into'}</strong>
									<small>{isEs ? 'Ingresa al código interno del método invocado' : 'Enters the invoked method’s internal code'}</small>
								</span>
							</button>
							<button class="dc-step-btn" id="dcStepOutBtn">
								<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19V5m-7 7 7-7 7 7" /></svg>
								<span>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Step Out' : 'Step Out'}</strong>
									<small>{isEs ? 'Termina el método y vuelve al llamador' : 'Finishes the method and returns to the caller'}</small>
								</span>
							</button>
							<button class="dc-step-btn" id="dcResumeBtn">
								<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="7 4 20 12 7 20" /></svg>
								<span>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Resume' : 'Resume'}</strong>
									<small>{isEs ? 'Continúa hasta el siguiente breakpoint' : 'Continues to the next breakpoint'}</small>
								</span>
							</button>

							<div class="dc-nested-panel" id="dcNestedPanel">
								<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14m-7-7 7 7 7-7" /></svg>
								<span>{isEs ? 'Dentro de applyBulkDiscount(int subtotal)' : 'Inside applyBulkDiscount(int subtotal)'}</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="dc-ide-inspect">
							<div class="dc-panel-block">
								<div class="dc-panel-head">
									<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="6" x2="20" y2="6" /><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12" /><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="14" y2="18" /></svg>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Variables Locales' : 'Local Variables'}</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="dc-var-row"><span>order</span><code>Order@0x4f2a</code></div>
								<div class="dc-var-row"><span>itemCount</span><code>3</code></div>
								<div class="dc-var-row"><span>subtotal</span><code id="dcVarSubtotal">0.0</code></div>
							</div>
							<div class="dc-panel-block">
								<div class="dc-panel-head">
									<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5" /><line x1="8" y1="19" x2="16" y2="19" /></svg>
									<strong>{isEs ? 'Watches' : 'Watches'}</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="dc-var-row"><span>order.getItems().size()</span><code>3</code></div>
							</div>
							<p class="dc-subtext" id="dcExecStatus">{isEs ? 'Detenido en breakpoint · línea 3' : 'Stopped at breakpoint · line 3'}</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Slide 3: Museo Gráfico de Code Smells -->
			<section class="dc-slide" data-slide="3">
				<div class="dc-header">
					<span class="dc-kicker">{isEs ? 'Diseño Débil' : 'Weak Design'}</span>
					<h2 class="dc-title">{isEs ? 'Museo Gráfico de Code Smells' : 'Code Smells Gallery'}</h2>
					<p class="dc-lead">
						{isEs
							? 'Un code smell no impide compilar: es una señal de que el código será frágil y costoso de mantener a futuro. Elegí uno para ver su extracto de código y su prescripción técnica.'
							: 'A code smell does not stop the code from compiling: it signals the code will be fragile and costly to maintain later. Pick one to see its code excerpt and technical prescription.'}
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="dc-card">
					<div class="dc-smell-tabs">
						<button class="dc-tab is-active" data-smell="long-method">
							<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="3" /><line x1="10" y1="7" x2="14" y2="7" /><line x1="10" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11" /><line x1="10" y1="15" x2="14" y2="15" /></svg>
							<span>Long Method</span>
						</button>
						<button class="dc-tab" data-smell="primitive-obsession">
							<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="9" x2="20" y2="9" /><line x1="4" y1="15" x2="20" y2="15" /><line x1="10" y1="3" x2="8" y2="21" /><line x1="16" y1="3" x2="14" y2="21" /></svg>
							<span>Primitive Obsession</span>
						</button>
						<button class="dc-tab" data-smell="feature-envy">
							<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="7" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="17" cy="12" r="4" /><line x1="11" y1="12" x2="13" y2="12" /></svg>
							<span>Feature Envy</span>
						</button>
						<button class="dc-tab" data-smell="god-class">
							<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="4" rx="1" /><rect x="3" y="10" width="18" height="4" rx="1" /><rect x="3" y="16" width="18" height="4" rx="1" /></svg>
							<span>God Class</span>
						</button>
					</div>

					<div class="dc-smell-panels">
						<div class="dc-smell-panel is-active" data-smell="long-method">
							<p class="dc-subtext">{isEs ? 'Un método que hace demasiado, línea tras línea, imposible de leer de un vistazo.' : 'A method that does too much, line after line, impossible to read at a glance.'}</p>
							<pre class="dc-pre"><code>public void procesarPedido(Pedido pedido) &#123;
    // valida cliente...
    // valida stock...
    // calcula subtotal...
    // aplica descuentos...
    // calcula impuestos...
    // ... 150 líneas más ...
    // genera factura y notifica
&#125;</code></pre>
							<div class="dc-info-callout">
								<strong>{isEs ? 'Prescripción: ' : 'Prescription: '}</strong>{isEs ? 'Extract Method — dividir cada bloque de responsabilidad en un método propio, con nombre descriptivo.' : 'Extract Method — split each responsibility block into its own, descriptively named method.'}
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="dc-smell-panel" data-smell="primitive-obsession">
							<p class="dc-subtext">{isEs ? 'Modelar conceptos del dominio con tipos primitivos sueltos en vez de objetos con significado propio.' : 'Modeling domain concepts with loose primitive types instead of objects with their own meaning.'}</p>
							<pre class="dc-pre"><code>String telefono;
double precio;
String moneda;</code></pre>
							<div class="dc-info-callout">
								<strong>{isEs ? 'Prescripción: ' : 'Prescription: '}</strong>{isEs ? 'Introducir PhoneNumber y Money — objetos de valor que validan y agrupan su propio comportamiento.' : 'Introduce PhoneNumber and Money — value objects that validate and group their own behavior.'}
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="dc-smell-panel" data-smell="feature-envy">
							<p class="dc-subtext">{isEs ? 'Un método que está más interesado en los datos de otra clase que en los propios.' : 'A method more interested in another class’s data than its own.'}</p>
							<pre class="dc-pre"><code>// dentro de Factura
double total() &#123;
    return cliente.getPrecioBase()
        * cliente.getFactorDescuento()
        + cliente.getRecargoEnvio();
&#125;</code></pre>
							<div class="dc-info-callout">
								<strong>{isEs ? 'Prescripción: ' : 'Prescription: '}</strong>{isEs ? 'Move Method — trasladar el cálculo a Cliente, que es dueño real de esos datos.' : 'Move Method — relocate the calculation into Cliente, the real owner of that data.'}
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="dc-smell-panel" data-smell="god-class">
							<p class="dc-subtext">{isEs ? 'Una clase que absorbió responsabilidades de todo el sistema.' : 'A class that absorbed responsibilities from the whole system.'}</p>
							<pre class="dc-pre"><code>class SistemaManager &#123;
    // 50 métodos: login(), facturar(),
    // enviarEmail(), generarReporte()...
    // 3.000 líneas en total
&#125;</code></pre>
							<div class="dc-info-callout">
								<strong>{isEs ? 'Prescripción: ' : 'Prescription: '}</strong>{isEs ? 'Dividir por responsabilidad única: AuthService, FacturacionService, NotificacionService...' : 'Split by single responsibility: AuthService, BillingService, NotificationService...'}
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

